{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“不容易理顺的牵扯”概括成“牵挂”，弱化了原稿中内在纠结、难以理顺的意味。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把紧绷松开引申为“疲惫”，原稿只表达不再用力维持好感觉、紧张稍稍放松，并没有明确表达疲惫。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“原本安静的满足慢慢变成更强的渴望”概括成“幸福和渴望逐渐增强”，弱化了从满足转向渴望这一关键变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线与完整稿是同一件事：一个人反复体会亲近，在渴望、克制、幸福、失衡、酸楚与不舍之间起伏，最后重新获得暂时的踏实与安定；虽然部分屏幕遗漏了不急于结果、满足转为渴望等细节，也有少量情绪词偏差，但没有改变整个故事的性质和发展方向。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "40609c5c-743a-4327-abbe-3d9e64b051be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T150819423785Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:10:07.116297+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "req